[PrintTextModified Text:——在她走进审判庭时。|#0104Adv07_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Margo.Pensive1

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊，艾玛也来了。|#0104Adv07_Margo001| AuthorId:Margo RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Pensive1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:又出一桩麻烦事……<br>拜托，能不能放过我啊。|#0104Adv07_Coco001| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_3_1_Loop IntroBgmPath:Bgm_3_1_Intro Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛一眼就看到了可可口中的“麻烦事”。|#0104Adv07_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:在审判庭的正中央，<br>在那最引人注目的处刑台上，有一具尸体。|#0104Adv07_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

