[PrintTextModified Text:那是一名被捆绑在处刑台电椅上的少女。<br>任谁一看就知道，她已经没有生命迹象。|#0104Adv07_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:——她就是紫藤亚里沙。|#0104Adv07_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为什么亚里沙会……|#0104Adv07_Ema001| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露来得比其他人稍晚一些。她在看到亚里沙的尸体后<br>也无力地哭泣起来。|#0104Adv07_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙小姐……呜呜，为什么，为什么……<br>啊啊啊啊……|#0104Adv07_Meruru001| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:梅露露的哭叫声<br>回荡在整个审判庭中。|#0104Adv07_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Stills Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:把众人叫到审判庭来的典狱长，此刻却不知所踪，<br>又过了一会才来到审判庭。|#0104Adv07_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:人都到齐了吗？<br>黑部奈叶香小姐还是老样子，不见人影啊。|#0104Adv07_Warden001| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:好啦，如各位所见，<br>由于发生了凶杀案，<br>接下来将举行魔女审判。|#0104Adv07_Warden002| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:反正现在没剩几个人了，<br>大家也不用想太多，好吗。<br>审判就定在正午开始吧。|#0104Adv07_Warden003| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Coco.Angry1,ArmL2

[PrintTextModified Text:你这家伙就没打算给时间我们去调查吗！|#0104Adv07_Coco002| AuthorId:Coco RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Warden.1

[PrintTextModified Text:哎呀，我是希望快点结束这段不愉快的时间。|#0104Adv07_Warden004| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:请各位务必从在场的囚犯之中锁定杀人凶手的身份。<br>选中的人将以【魔女】的身份被处以死刑……<br>还有就是老规矩，如果无法锁定凶手，所有人都要接受处刑。|#0104Adv07_Warden005| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在原本是禁止外出时间，<br>但搜查期间允许自由出入。<br>那么，请各位努力找出凶手吧。|#0104Adv07_Warden006| AuthorId:Warden RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; フクロウの羽ばたき音
@PlaySfxModified SfxPath:Sfx_8 Volume:1 Loop:false FadeInDuration:0

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长还是老样子，<br>自顾自把话说完就飞走了。|#0104Adv07_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Ema.Pensive1,ArmR3

[PrintTextModified Text:……要找出，杀死亚里沙的凶手……|#0104Adv07_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛看了看在场所剩无几的少女。|#0104Adv07_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（玛格、可可、梅露露，<br>　然后还有不在场的奈叶香……）|#0104Adv07_Ema003|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（人也实在太少了……）|#0104Adv07_Ema004| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:直到现在梅露露依然泣不成声，一时半会应该没法行动。|#0104Adv07_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:玛格和可可摆出“跟你们没什么好商量的”的态度<br>快步走出了审判庭。|#0104Adv07_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:明明才找到线索，或许有办法揭开监牢秘密了，<br>没想到转眼就发生了凶案。|#0104Adv07_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:艾玛觉得力不从心，<br>只想闭上眼睛，捂住耳朵，对一切不闻不问。|#0104Adv07_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可是……可是，既然有人杀死了亚里沙……<br>　我就要找出真相才行……！）|#0104Adv07_Ema005|" AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

